nsistent with prevalence of trichiasis, prevalence of visual impairment (low vision and blindness) increased with age (<xref ref-type="table" rid="pntd-0000396-t003">Table 3</xref>).</p><table-wrap id="pntd-0000396-t003" position="float"><object-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pntd.0000396.t003</object-id><label>Table 3</label><caption><title>Age and gender specific prevalence of trichiasis and trichiasis vision status.</title></caption><graphic id="pntd-0000396-t003-3" xlink:href="pntd.0000396.t003"/><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" alternate-form-of="pntd-0000396-t003-3"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age Group (years)</td><td colspan="7" align="left" rowspan="1">Males</td><td colspan="7" align="left" rowspan="1">Females</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of People Surveyed</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">People with TT</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TT Prevalence (Estimated)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TT Prevalence (Smoothed)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="nt104">&#x0002a;</xref></td><td colspan="3" align="left" rowspan="1">Prevalence of Vision Status<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="nt105">&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of People Surveyed</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">People with TT</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TT Prevalence (Estimated)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"